<p>Local SEO is the difference between ranking for searches nobody near you makes and appearing the moment someone nearby searches for exactly what you offer. For many small businesses, this is where the fastest wins are.</p>

<h2>What is included</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Google Business Profile setup or full optimisation</li>
  <li>Local citations and consistent name, address and phone details across the web</li>
  <li>A review strategy: getting more reviews and responding to them well</li>
  <li>Local keyword targeting for your town, region or service area</li>
  <li>Location pages where more than one service area matters</li>
</ul>

<p>This pairs well with a technical audit, since local ranking signals and on-site technical health reinforce each other.</p>
